OL,3,ARussell Brand's ex Jemima Goldsmith
OL,4,Aaccuses him of violence and abuse
OL,5,Aagainst her
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,8,Fcontent.
OL,10,FJemima Goldsmith, the ex-girlfriend of
OL,11,FRussell Brand, has accused him of
OL,12,F"violence, coercive control and abuse"
OL,13,Fwhile the two were together.
OL,15,FGoldsmith, who dated the disgraced
OL,16,Fentertainer for roughly a year around
OL,17,F2014, alleged that she "had to call the
OL,18,Fpolice to have him removed from my
OL,19,Fhouse in 2014 during a violent
OL,20,Fincident" but chose not to press
OL,21,Fcharges.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
