OL,3,ARussell Brand's ex Jemima Goldsmith
OL,4,Aaccuses him of violence and abuse
OL,5,Aagainst her
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a lengthy statement on social media,
OL,8,Fthe 52-year-old said she was "in awe of
OL,9,Fthe courageous women who came forward
OL,10,Fat Brand's trial" and was "glad and
OL,11,Frelieved" he had "finally faced
OL,12,Fjustice".
